    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 5,
        "sourceEnd": 49,
        "text": "Hi, Ben. You look tired today. Are you okay?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "ebf05ce6cce5858349801740b91e4b1a4e0d56779cca0faa53f37c8b4f3c137c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 55,
        "sourceEnd": 168,
        "text": "Hi, Mia. Yes, I'm fine, but I'm a little tired. I went to bed late last night because I watched a football match.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "9dca907ec5ec4b3e1fc1fec16a4add291af97bdaa37ed2a89f09107e7d949898",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 174,
        "sourceEnd": 250,
        "text": "Oh, I see. You should go to bed earlier. Sleep is very important for health.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "7f3d6214990eea85ea6ef81b0a8f6d0cb71430f6702671b461fd71ffb5349129",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 256,
        "sourceEnd": 349,
        "text": "You're right. I usually sleep about six hours, but I know I should sleep more. How about you?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "dd4754f2a6ff84ada961c7984a6d29655e47b456f8ae3b067298d1d42233438f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 355,
        "sourceEnd": 451,
        "text": "I sleep about eight hours every night. I feel good because I go to bed at ten and get up at six.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "c2184e110558436da74041c83642ba2570fc8b762433f3a6a7a391554c90fcb2",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 457,
        "sourceEnd": 497,
        "text": "That's a good habit. Do you do exercise?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "f687d08dc352fc8e7b3af7b3def93cf70eaad09ebccfa9b8e1e63b85a338fcec",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 503,
        "sourceEnd": 650,
        "text": "Yes, I do. I go swimming twice a week. It's my favourite sport. I think swimming is the best exercise for me because it's fun and good for my back.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "6e4d76df3f7d3d39d3e702f5efa90056f5e2463e22f99f4aad9125c7c633925f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 656,
        "sourceEnd": 741,
        "text": "I don't like swimming. I prefer running. I run in the park every morning before work.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "3e9170a3835ec296c9c611b16892133756812cfd3963951b2f6b3c9c4222f3cf",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 747,
        "sourceEnd": 868,
        "text": "That's great. Running is faster than walking, so it's good for your heart. But you should be careful. Don't run too fast.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "6f8b325a3b64ca1cf231373e098dd3184fd2a2d257d85c78c5d817d9d6a3e13b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 874,
        "sourceEnd": 942,
        "text": "I know. I run slowly. But sometimes I feel very tired after running.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "8b8168cba999179de8b9fe1c4194ac1c4920743b658e21410604a2fc4b85056b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 948,
        "sourceEnd": 1024,
        "text": "Maybe you should eat a good breakfast. A healthy breakfast gives you energy.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "fbecc9671ad27224a7992a59f594c037d2b801e13fb70e0029e2c27339834932",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1030,
        "sourceEnd": 1082,
        "text": "I usually eat a banana and some bread. Is that okay?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "8b35b56ad947c305d9fc9f46c670ff951a60ff59b4246d9af143fc8d8de56637",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1088,
        "sourceEnd": 1178,
        "text": "Yes, that's fine. But you should also drink water. Water is better than coffee for health.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "ed56ac5e0c2ff321eb371c6f62ceacd18dcc523e95afa1c93bcc31b50ed76a2b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1184,
        "sourceEnd": 1268,
        "text": "I drink a lot of coffee because I work in an office. I feel sleepy in the afternoon.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "63d81262d8904362dfa47e8785e4285ddb502f4f6297d6696a652a5c00de4e55",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1274,
        "sourceEnd": 1363,
        "text": "Coffee is okay, but water is the best drink. You should drink more water and less coffee.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "104ac421af788217b188a60a37dea9ea3f83a40ee17bd74e01085ab83906c3a2",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1369,
        "sourceEnd": 1415,
        "text": "Okay, I will try. Thanks for your advice, Mia.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "594625b514b828acbcc821e268d00db9e35abff03561023d41686e38deac324b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1421,
        "sourceEnd": 1499,
        "text": "You're welcome. Remember, good habits are the most important thing for health.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "821cb9a505af7f10bd8cb6aa051b04feddc29a73b672376468dc9154c9e0bdc6",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
